<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάψ</span></b>  (B), Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in vain, without result</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. οὕτω . . πολεμίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.120
				</span></i>
			; <i>without aim or object</i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.298
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>vainly, falsely</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ὀμόσαιμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.40
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. αὔτως εὐχετάασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.348
				</span></i>
			; <i>thoughtlessly, recklessly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον ἔδοντας μ. αὔτως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.111
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἀτὰρ οὐ κατὰ κόσμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.214
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.759
			</span></i>; <i>in haste</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.138
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			 word, in compds. Poet., mostly 
				Ep.
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
